[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12541.83, "timestamp": "03:29:01", "text": "哇。好的。他们有电视订阅服务"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12546.07, "timestamp": "03:29:06", "text": "服务也很好。太多了。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.91, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "我猜也许这就是他们那样的原因吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12550.469, "timestamp": "03:29:10", "text": "在某些方面格外严格，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12554.71, "timestamp": "03:29:14", "text": "监管直播之类的，因为如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12556.87, "timestamp": "03:29:16", "text": "如果有人要上去的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12558.95, "timestamp": "03:29:18", "text": "他们只是想娱乐，并不想喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12560.55, "timestamp": "03:29:20", "text": "可能会来到一条小溪边"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12564.07, "timestamp": "03:29:24", "text": "什么事都没发生，或者你知道我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12565.349, "timestamp": "03:29:25", "text": "不知道，因为那样他们就永远不会想要了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12569.11, "timestamp": "03:29:29", "text": "进入应用程序本身。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12571.91, "timestamp": "03:29:31", "text": "哦，有意思。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12573.91, "timestamp": "03:29:33", "text": "但我没有，我没想到会这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.03, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "审查制度如此极端，或者像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12578.95, "timestamp": "03:29:38", "text": "实际上，不，审查制度才是关键所在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.75, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "因为它是有意义的，它是基于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12585.349, "timestamp": "03:29:45", "text": "中国？是的，它在中国。是的。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12587.11, "timestamp": "03:29:47", "text": "好的。是的，这很有道理。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12589.83, "timestamp": "03:29:49", "text": "没关系。是啊，就像审查制度一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12592.63, "timestamp": "03:29:52", "text": "那边局势相当紧张。嗯，但是就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12594.79, "timestamp": "03:29:54", "text": "哇。当我觉得它像那样的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12596.15, "timestamp": "03:29:56", "text": "最让我措手不及的是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12599.03, "timestamp": "03:29:59", "text": "比如，当你只是放松休息的时候"}]